{"about_the_game":"<strong>You're a computer virus, tasked with the job of taking over different machines. Use the data collected to improve your ability to take over by upgrading your arsenal of abilities!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/7c6ee810f25fc3621425f3ef74b39f00.avif?t=1744845117\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/7b8e6e9383864ec2f82304d8916d3f5f.avif?t=1744845117\" width=600 height=208 /></span><br>Put your platforming skills to the test with fun, but difficult level design that allows beginners enjoy the game, but also give more experienced players a much more difficult challenge!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/1ab380beb998b86519bd17689a7bdbf5.avif?t=1744845117\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/2884059c5e0d578580147e25da18f3fb.avif?t=1744845117\" width=600 height=208 /></span><br>Go up against different types of anti-viruses! Just because one of them may be weak, don't let your guard down!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/e140b4b52f97c71c1f39bdf8862c0edf.avif?t=1744845117\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/22f0cb4255ef80a5d8e160823bffc31b.avif?t=1744845117\" width=600 height=208 /></span><br>Take the data you collect from each system to upgrade your virus, ranging from different ways to attack, ways to move ar